WEBVTT

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:08.020
SILVER <b>Shooting Star Silver  </b>FANG

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:13.740
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
SILVER <b>Shooting Star Silver  </b>FANG

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:16.310
Mountains are calling

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.270
The sky is calling

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:27.780
Something awaits you in the distance

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:34.160
So brightly     the blood burns

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:42.290
You understand why you were born

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:44.630
Run and Run!

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:46.590
Run and Run!

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:50.170
Become the wind, and run

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:56.890
Go on, you're going to surpass the yesterdays you

00:00:57.140 --> 00:01:04.690
You will stand up to yourself     to greater things

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:07.900
That's right!     It is young

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:14.910
It doesn't burn out     A shooting star

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:35.830
<i>Males from all over the country
have gathered around Silver.</i>

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:39.570
<i>All are brave and strong.</i>

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:54.150
<i>Everyone is gathered around The Leader.
The time for the final battle has come.</i>

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:07.730
MORTAL COMBAT<i>!</i>
WHEN A MALE IS RISKING HIS LIFE<i>!!</i>

00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:12.670
Silver! Where are you going?

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:14.480
Just shut up and follow me!

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:31.030
Look! This is the other side of Twin Pass.

00:02:31.270 --> 00:02:32.490
Woah, It's a gorge!

00:02:38.990 --> 00:02:39.810
That is?...

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:41.300
Who is it?!

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:42.690
It's Silver!

00:02:42.710 --> 00:02:47.920
L-Leader! I didn't...
It was Silver, he went without permission...

00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:49.170
Keep quiet!

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:52.180
You are in the enemy's territory.

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:56.430
Silver, what are you doing here?

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:57.190
Right.

00:02:57.230 --> 00:02:58.630
And your reason?

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:00.440
Reply to my question!

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:03.170
Yes.

00:03:03.190 --> 00:03:08.900
I was wondering, if we are able to get into
the castle through the other side of Twin Pass...

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:09.690
What?

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:13.190
Leader, please don't make such a scary face.

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:17.290
Silver has a bad habit of sometimes
thinking strange things...

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:20.290
I was thinking the exact same thing.

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:23.630
Ben's right, you are clever, Silver.

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:38.030
<i>The Leader and Silver had the same strategy?
Can it be?</i>

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:46.270
<i>Then he maybe really is the Leader's son!</i>

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:48.390
Leader, please let me check.

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:52.630
I do not permit any unnecessary action!
The strategy has already been told!

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:56.390
Your task is to carry out the command!

00:03:56.390 --> 00:03:56.990
Understood!

00:03:57.730 --> 00:03:59.170
Let's go back Silver!

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:01.170
Silver!

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:05.000
I've heard from Ben about all
your activities on the trip.

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:06.960
You've done a good job.

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:11.010
The decisive battle will be tomorrow.

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:12.260
Look!

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:20.520
I was waiting for this typhoon.

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:25.490
I'll see you again tomorrow morning.
I'm counting on you.

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:29.770
<i>You will not be disappointed... Father!</i>

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:46.290
<i>On this day a large typhoon
landed in the Tohoku region.</i>

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:49.290
Everybody, form a line.

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:53.190
<i>The Leader's plan was this:</i>

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:58.050
<i>Akakabuto has built strong forts
at four locations in Twin Pass.</i>

00:04:58.300 --> 00:05:02.300
<i>The Leader divided them to four
battalions, to attack each Fort.</i>

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:09.650
<i>Three units were organized to break 1 Fort.
One at a time, attacking in a waves.</i>

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:16.790
<i>But in order for this operation to succeed, a risky
preemptive attack by an advance team is necessary.</i>

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:20.280
<i>The leader of each unit was
chosen for this task.</i>

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:23.960
<i>In the first advance team was:
Silver, Smith and Akame.</i>

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:27.460
<i>In the second: three brothers of Kai.</i>

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:30.460
<i>In the third: The Four Heavenly Kings of Mutsu.</i>

00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:35.630
<i>In the fourth:
John, Wilson and Benizakura was selected.</i>

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:40.830
Leader! We've completed the lineup!

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:43.630
<i>And finally the time of
the decisive battle has come!</i>

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:46.400
Everyone, Attack!

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:48.650
(All) Affirmative!

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:00.540
Silver! Don't die!

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:03.770
Akatora, not you guys either!

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:04.790
Okay!

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:11.840
I don't wanna die yet!

00:06:16.090 --> 00:06:16.690
Leader.

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:19.350
Please let me go too.

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:23.800
With them risking their lives, I don't
want an excuse to escape the battle.

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:28.190
You stay here, and respond
to each squad's battle report.

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:33.230
Why? I'm not a tactician!
I'm a Platoon Leader!

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:39.150
Ben, you need strong will and courage.
But that's not all.

00:06:39.320 --> 00:06:40.500
Look behind you.

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:50.120
Ben! Your mission ends here.
Go down to the village.

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:50.870
Leader...

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:58.380
Take care of the Cross and the kids!

00:06:58.980 --> 00:06:59.890
Leader!

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:03.810
Leader...

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:06.940
Ben!

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:08.690
Cross... you...

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:09.690
Ben...

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:14.940
I'm gonna watch my friends die and
I will always regret that.

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:17.900
Don't worry about the puppies.

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:19.940
Cross...

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:27.960
There...

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:32.210
Say goodbye to the puppies.

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:42.010
Cross, I'm not going to die.

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:46.260
I'm going to be a male.
I don't have to say goodbye.

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:47.770
Ben...

00:07:58.840 --> 00:08:01.950
Cross, I'm counting on you.

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:13.210
Stop! A male should not cry!

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:17.270
Don't cry...

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:26.060
There are seven bears in the fort.

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:28.390
The fort-commander is-

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:29.890
- Madara from Miyagi.

00:08:29.910 --> 00:08:30.890
Madara!

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:31.940
That bastard!

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:42.790
The last time he ambushed us
and killed one of our friends.

00:08:42.920 --> 00:08:45.410
Now I will take revenge...

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:49.870
Don't be hasty, Smith! The first unit will
go after us in the advance team.

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:54.590
Hakuro's second unit, and the Moss'
third unit, will be waiting-

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:56.710
- and prepare the attack wave!

00:08:56.740 --> 00:08:57.460
Understood!

00:08:57.560 --> 00:09:00.210
Silver! Don't take on too much now!

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:03.340
You have have Moss from
The Misty Mountain available here!

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:04.770
Yeah I know!

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:05.720
Come on!

00:09:14.350 --> 00:09:15.810
First unit! Attack!

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:35.210
Smith! Take the left one!
I'll take the right!

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:36.210
Yeah!

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:45.720
This is for all my friends!

00:09:46.680 --> 00:09:47.720
Smith! Let go!

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:49.970
If you hold on to him too long,
you're going to die.

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:52.880
Smith!

00:09:56.640 --> 00:09:57.470
Smith!

00:10:04.990 --> 00:10:07.630
Silver! You are surrounded!

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:09.370
<i>Dammit!</i>

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:10.550
<i>It's a wall of claws!</i>

00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:19.250
Silver, Take care of yourself!

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:36.700
You did it, Silver!

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:41.900
How dare you hurt Smith?

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:51.950
First unit! Attack!

00:11:18.980 --> 00:11:21.480
Second unit! Attack!

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:28.530
<i>I can smell the leader's scent right
behind the mountain.</i>

00:11:29.550 --> 00:11:31.530
<i>But back there is a gorge.</i>

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:34.790
<i>Maybe The Leader climbed up that cliff.</i>

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:37.580
<i>And intends to fight in
single combat with Akakabuto.</i>

00:11:49.050 --> 00:11:52.550
My eye-sight… Now of all times,
am I losing it again?

00:11:58.220 --> 00:11:59.220
<i>It's back!</i>

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:03.270
<i>So, is this a sign of relapse?</i>

00:12:04.270 --> 00:12:09.630
<i>Even if it is cured temporarily,
if you neglect later treatments-</i>

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:13.870
<i>- Ben will be in danger of
becoming blind for life.</i>

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:17.500
<i>I don't care... I need to hurry!</i>

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:25.800
<i>The Leader climbed up here...</i>

00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:33.710
<i>Can I make it?</i>

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:41.020
<i>I need to, by using the the wind.</i>

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:54.870
<i>The Leader must not die alone.</i>

00:13:09.940 --> 00:13:10.930
<i>Dammit!</i>

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:13.430
Good upper hand here, Ben!

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:31.400
<i>Can he see me?</i>

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:34.910
You…
Commander Sniper?

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:46.170
How amusing that you can't see. I'm going
to torment you, slowly, to death!

00:13:46.210 --> 00:13:48.670
Why do you hate me?

00:13:48.670 --> 00:13:53.140
You're forgetting the mission,
making trouble for us!

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.190
Wake up, you fool!

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:58.430
My friends are fighting for their lives at this moment!

00:13:58.470 --> 00:13:59.640
Shut up!

00:14:00.010 --> 00:14:03.980
Smith was injured. Can anyone take
his place in the advance party?

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:05.430
I will do it!

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:07.400
Hakuro!

00:14:08.150 --> 00:14:10.240
I am known as the "Brownbear-killer".

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:11.400
Trust me on this!

00:14:12.150 --> 00:14:15.900
Damn it! I can't die before
I have carried out the assignment.

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:20.910
Smith, lie still!
Can someone take care of him?

00:14:21.410 --> 00:14:23.370
What are you doing? Let go!

00:14:23.830 --> 00:14:24.920
Silver, let's go!

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:25.580
Okay!

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:35.130
<i>I can't die here!
If only I could see!</i>

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:39.300
Sniper, think about it!

00:14:39.300 --> 00:14:40.060
Shut up!

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:43.740
The Twin Pass does not belong to
either The Leader or Akakabuto!

00:14:44.060 --> 00:14:44.830
It's mine!

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:51.720
In order to make it mine,
you and Silver need to die!

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:52.860
I see?

00:14:52.970 --> 00:14:53.870
Die!

00:14:59.780 --> 00:15:01.540
Don't look down on me!

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:05.290
One or two dogs like you,
I can manage to take with me!

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:07.290
Even though I can't see!

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:09.540
Take with...?

00:15:10.040 --> 00:15:11.290
That's right.

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:15.300
<i>Ben will die!</i>

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:18.430
<i>It's the only way he
can defeat Sniper!</i>

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:20.800
Wait, Ben!
Are you crazy?

00:15:20.800 --> 00:15:22.810
This is the only way i can help?

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:25.560
I'm going to die with you,
to protect Silver and the others!

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:29.850
Idiot! You are going in the wrong direction!

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:33.030
The wind is telling me
I'm on the right track.

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:35.320
Wait, Ben!

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:42.120
B-Ben! Don't die for him!

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:44.950
Stop it, Ben! Don't be rash...!

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:48.620
<i>Silver... take care of everyone!</i>

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:51.420
<i>Cross, look after the puppies!</i>

00:15:54.040 --> 00:16:09.820
Ben!

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:18.020
<i>Ben threw himself down the cliff,
sacrificing his life.</i>

00:16:18.530 --> 00:16:21.280
<i>Without even putting
his fangs in Akakabuto.</i>

00:16:27.990 --> 00:16:32.790
<i>What a male I am!
Why didn't I try to save Ben?</i>

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:35.010
I'm such a coward!

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:35.760
I'm such a coward!

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:36.010
such a coward!
I'm such a coward!

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:36.680
such a coward!

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:37.260
Coward!
such a coward!

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:38.260
Coward!

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:44.800
<i>However, Ben's sacrifice brought up something
that slumbered at the bottom of the Hyena's heart.</i>

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:47.550
<i>A sense of courage and justice.</i>

00:16:47.850 --> 00:16:53.850
<i>Hyena! Be a real male at least once in your
lifetime! Even if you die in the process!</i>

00:17:00.020 --> 00:17:02.320
Ben!

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:13.280
The 3rd unit! Attack!

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:22.470
Okay! Now!

00:17:26.680 --> 00:17:27.910
Hurry and kill him!

00:17:46.780 --> 00:17:49.410
Move away! I'll drag him down!

00:17:49.490 --> 00:17:50.540
Wait, Hakuro!

00:17:50.950 --> 00:17:51.540
What?

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:53.040
Observe!

00:17:59.670 --> 00:18:00.550
(Iga Ninja Technique - Thunder Flower Sword)
Iga Ninja Technique

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:00.890
Raikaken
(Iga Ninja Technique - Thunder Flower Sword)
Iga Ninja Technique

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:01.630
(Iga Ninja Technique - Thunder Flower Sword)
Raikaken

00:18:01.630 --> 00:18:02.010
Raikaken

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:02.100
Whats this?
Raikaken

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:02.730
Whats this?

00:18:03.050 --> 00:18:06.110
When did Silver learn this technique?

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:13.830
Run away!

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:17.350
Now! Get him!

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:35.960
It's Madara!

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:37.960
So he is the Commander of this fort?

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:38.870
That's right!

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:45.260
Be careful... Madara is tough!

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:50.550
Everyone! Don't run away!

00:18:54.350 --> 00:18:58.850
Silver! if we take him out,
we've won this fort!

00:18:59.230 --> 00:19:02.600
Okay! Leave it to Hakuro,
the Brown Bear killer!

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:04.100
Hakuro, be careful!

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:06.850
It's nothing!
I'll just go for the eyes!

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:07.700
Here I go!

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:17.830
He predicted it!

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:18.380
Hakuro!

00:19:26.550 --> 00:19:27.550
Thank you, Silver!

00:19:29.300 --> 00:19:30.390
Silver, watch out!

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:31.060
Run!

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:34.020
Come on!

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:43.980
Oh, he's tough!

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:45.730
Bastard! Come on, Akame!

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:46.280
Wait!

00:19:49.280 --> 00:19:51.280
Kirikaze and Jinnai is going
to attack from above.

00:19:52.660 --> 00:19:55.030
At that moment,
we're going aim at the throat!

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:55.870
Okay!

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:57.170
Here, Madara!

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:13.980
Jinnai!

00:20:14.640 --> 00:20:15.560
Kirikaze, don't do it!

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:24.520
Kirikaze!

00:20:25.980 --> 00:20:27.770
Kirikaze, hang in there!

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:30.740
Master, I'm begging you...

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:31.990
Kirikaze...

00:20:34.740 --> 00:20:35.490
Mr. Akame...

00:20:35.530 --> 00:20:39.160
If someone doesn't sacrifice himself,
we can't take him down!

00:20:39.240 --> 00:20:40.200
Wait, Silver!

00:20:40.240 --> 00:20:44.740
No. I've been ready since I was
chosen to be in the advance team!

00:20:44.740 --> 00:20:45.750
Then together!

00:20:48.210 --> 00:20:49.500
Okay, me too then!

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:52.500
Go! All three of us at once!

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:03.770
Silver! If it has come to this!
Then all males, attack!

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:15.070
Take this!

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:23.300
Aim at his feet!
Stop him!

00:21:33.960 --> 00:21:36.220
All right, he stopped!

00:21:36.780 --> 00:21:38.180
A little more!

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:40.430
Hurry up and fall!

00:21:54.450 --> 00:21:55.580
Watch out, Silver!

00:21:58.660 --> 00:22:00.120
You're gonna collide with a tree.

00:22:06.130 --> 00:22:07.840
What a destructive force!

00:22:11.840 --> 00:22:16.300
<i>Not even the triple attack
and wave brought Madara down.</i>

00:22:17.130 --> 00:22:20.880
<i>His title as Akakabuto's right
arm, was well deserved.</i>

00:22:22.140 --> 00:22:24.630
<i>However, Silver did not hesitate.</i>

00:22:26.890 --> 00:22:33.360
<i>Meanwhile, what's happened to The Leader, who
has challenged Akakabuto behind the Twin Pass?</i>

00:22:35.410 --> 00:22:38.160
<i>With entrusting Silver's
group to Akakabuto-</i>

00:22:38.530 --> 00:22:42.160
<i>- Ben's fate was to fall
to the bottom of the valley...</i>

00:22:47.820 --> 00:22:52.790
<i>In the midst of the storm, the fight to
the death continued without any end.</i>

00:22:54.630 --> 00:23:00.670
To be continued...

00:23:14.830 --> 00:23:20.080
When a shower of a moonlight

00:23:21.050 --> 00:23:26.210
bathes you gently

00:23:27.310 --> 00:23:32.350
Say goodbye to pain and

00:23:34.190 --> 00:23:40.910
let it flow away

00:23:41.070 --> 00:23:46.910
For he who lives today with all his heart

00:23:47.210 --> 00:23:53.540
a better tomorrow will surely come

00:23:53.880 --> 00:23:59.720
TOMORROW, let us run again

00:24:00.550 --> 00:24:05.600
TOMORROW, lets shine brightly
